  "cut": [],
  "desc": "A HoH1 classic: fast, fragile and always behind you. Throwing knives, a grappling hook and smoke bombs; masters as Assassin (crits and shadow strikes), Trickster (frenzy and caltrops) or Shadow (cloaks and poison). HoH1 kit: Twin Daggers (attack); Throwing Knives, Grappling Hook, Smoke Bomb (actives); Sidestep, Slice and Dice, Vicious Cuts (passives). Here the daggers are the starting weapon, the three actives and Sidestep are the base kit, Vicious Cuts is the Assassin's, and Slice and Dice is now the Trickster's active self-buff.",
